<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures quiet in light trade.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures quiet in light trade.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat futures showed little or no movement in a light day of floor trading at the Sydney Futures Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trading of two lots left January wheat A$2.00 down at A$165.00 a tonne. Grains traders said lower values overnight in Chicago discouraged activity in the local market.  </p>
